WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.803
Settings → Sub-workspaces, on the primary

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.024
Click New sub-workspace

00:00:06.024 --> 00:00:08.519
Name it

00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:11.630
Click Create sub-workspace

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:20.653
Click Manage to allocate concurrency

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.593
Click Save concurrency

00:00:23.593 --> 00:00:30.732
Billing: move part of the balance to it

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:40.761
Members: invite someone to this sub-workspace only

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:45.284
People shows everyone's access across the family
